WEBVTT

00:01:45.952 --> 00:01:51.525
The blue sky, the sparkling
ocean, a nice, relaxing time.

00:01:51.525 --> 00:01:54.494
Yeah, this is great.

00:01:56.897 --> 00:02:04.871
I think I'm like a shiny pearl on the beach,
or beautiful coral on the bottom of the ocean.

00:02:04.871 --> 00:02:08.008
I think you've been in the sun too long.

00:02:08.008 --> 00:02:09.976
And you have, too.

00:02:11.778 --> 00:02:14.548
And how come you two aren't working, huh?

00:02:14.548 --> 00:02:15.916
Shame on you!

00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:18.985
Everybody else is
working really hard, you know!

00:02:18.985 --> 00:02:21.721
Ice cream! Anybody want ice cream?

00:02:21.721 --> 00:02:23.957
Get your ice cream!

00:02:23.957 --> 00:02:27.260
It's very cold!

00:02:27.260 --> 00:02:32.721
Crushed ice. Crushed ice, anyone?

00:02:33.600 --> 00:02:36.068
Come on. We'd better get to work.

00:02:41.074 --> 00:02:42.676
You know what?

00:02:42.676 --> 00:02:44.610
No, Dad. What is it?

00:02:45.879 --> 00:02:48.348
We're not getting any customers at all.

00:02:48.348 --> 00:02:50.475
We sure aren't.

00:03:22.883 --> 00:03:26.353
"Shaved Ice"

00:03:26.353 --> 00:03:30.346
"Tenchi Snack Shop"

00:03:34.828 --> 00:03:38.064
Our business is doing
much worse than I expected.

00:03:38.064 --> 00:03:40.433
The universe is a cold place, huh?

00:03:40.433 --> 00:03:42.736
Yes, well, it is hot outside, though.

00:03:42.736 --> 00:03:47.366
Forget the repairs. We can't
even pay Yagami's docking fee.

00:03:48.675 --> 00:03:50.110
'Scuse me.

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:52.345
Uh... Yes?

00:03:52.345 --> 00:03:54.347
Can I get three shaved ices?

00:03:54.347 --> 00:03:57.617
Sorry, but we're out of ice right now.

00:03:57.617 --> 00:03:59.886
Really? What a bummer.

00:03:59.886 --> 00:04:01.254
Yeah. We're sorry.

00:04:01.254 --> 00:04:03.423
Oh, well. I'll just go someplace else.

00:04:03.423 --> 00:04:06.793
And I thought we had a customer.

00:04:06.793 --> 00:04:08.428
We set up this snack shop on the beach!

00:04:08.428 --> 00:04:10.697
It's summertime. Why didn't we get any ice?!

00:04:10.697 --> 00:04:13.967
Well, I just don't understand it.
Of course I got ice.

00:04:13.967 --> 00:04:16.836
Then I don't understand
why we don't have any!

00:04:16.836 --> 00:04:18.038
Wow.

00:04:18.038 --> 00:04:20.472
It's hot, isn't it, everybody?

00:04:31.518 --> 00:04:33.587
Yeah! Hits the spot!

00:04:33.587 --> 00:04:37.523
I should have known... it was you!

00:04:49.269 --> 00:04:52.439
I will track you down, Ryoko.

00:04:52.439 --> 00:04:55.704
I know you are somewhere on this planet!

00:05:09.289 --> 00:05:11.124
Who was that?

00:05:11.124 --> 00:05:12.989
I don't know.

00:05:19.466 --> 00:05:21.525
Here, Ryo-Ohki.

00:05:22.969 --> 00:05:26.172
Ah, Mihoshi, can I get a little
more strawberry syrup here please,

00:05:26.172 --> 00:05:28.341
thank you very much.

00:05:28.341 --> 00:05:30.002
All right!

00:05:31.311 --> 00:05:35.815
Don't be stingy, now.
After all, we don't have any more ice.

00:05:35.815 --> 00:05:37.817
Melon syrup for me!

00:05:37.817 --> 00:05:41.254
Something that isn't so
sweet, that's my preference.

00:05:41.254 --> 00:05:44.591
Huh? Where's Kiyone?

00:05:44.591 --> 00:05:47.492
She's got another part-time job.

00:05:50.697 --> 00:05:52.832
Hey! You kids over there!

00:05:52.832 --> 00:05:56.097
You shouldn't go into
that area! It's dangerous!

00:06:06.713 --> 00:06:08.982
Kiyone sure is a bundle of energy.

00:06:08.982 --> 00:06:12.383
And she looks like she's
been a lifeguard for years.

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:16.623
How about we get back to work?

00:06:16.623 --> 00:06:19.693
Ah, I think we need a siesta.

00:06:19.693 --> 00:06:22.062
How about doing something
besides figuring out ways

00:06:22.062 --> 00:06:24.497
to sit around and do nothing?!

00:06:24.497 --> 00:06:28.201
And you weren't just
kicking back and relaxing, too?

00:06:28.201 --> 00:06:31.037
Ladies and gentlemen, may
I have your attention, please?

00:06:31.037 --> 00:06:37.510
Today at 3:00, we will be holding a
swimsuit contest on our special stage.

00:06:37.510 --> 00:06:40.847
We'd like to take this opportunity
to encourage your participation.

00:06:40.847 --> 00:06:46.052
The winner of this contest
will receive one million Jurai!

00:06:46.052 --> 00:06:48.354
One million Jurai?!

00:06:48.354 --> 00:06:51.658
Oh! Finally, some good fortune!

00:06:51.658 --> 00:06:53.626
Sasami, did you hear that?

00:06:53.626 --> 00:06:54.928
I did! I did!

00:06:54.928 --> 00:06:57.764
He said that the winner will
take home one million Jurai!

00:06:57.764 --> 00:06:59.332
Yeah, that's what he said.

00:06:59.332 --> 00:07:01.835
But you only get the million if you win.

00:07:01.835 --> 00:07:03.169
Well, don't you worry, Tenchi.

00:07:03.169 --> 00:07:06.873
It we all enter the contest,
one of us should be able to win.

00:07:06.873 --> 00:07:09.776
There's more to winning
this than luck, you know.

00:07:09.776 --> 00:07:11.678
No need to worry.

00:07:11.678 --> 00:07:14.948
All I need to do is enter.

00:07:14.948 --> 00:07:18.752
In order to get to the
planet Jurai and see justice done,

00:07:18.752 --> 00:07:22.055
I'm more than happy to
show my smooth skin in public.

00:07:22.055 --> 00:07:25.892
Just a minute! This looks like a job for me.

00:07:25.892 --> 00:07:28.793
Don't enter a contest you can't win, Ayeka.

00:07:29.896 --> 00:07:32.699
Ryoko, this looks like
the perfect opportunity

00:07:32.699 --> 00:07:36.569
to settle our differences once
and for all, wouldn't you agree?

00:07:36.569 --> 00:07:37.470
Why not?

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:40.633
This contest will finally
show who the real winner is.

00:07:53.253 --> 00:07:57.053
Ryoko, where are you hiding yourself?

00:08:04.397 --> 00:08:08.060
- Wow!
- These are so cute!

00:08:10.003 --> 00:08:12.870
I can't decide which one to wear!

00:08:15.909 --> 00:08:18.845
Hey, Kiyone, what do
you think of this one, huh?

00:08:18.845 --> 00:08:23.116
- Mmm. A bit too flashy.
- Hmm. Then what about this one?

00:08:23.116 --> 00:08:24.884
Oh, that one's cute!

00:08:24.884 --> 00:08:26.219
Think so?

00:08:26.219 --> 00:08:29.122
Uh, isn't that a bit too
small for you, Mihoshi?

00:08:29.122 --> 00:08:32.158
Hey, I'm not fat, Kiyone.

00:08:32.158 --> 00:08:35.252
You know what? I wish
I could be in the contest.

00:08:43.903 --> 00:08:46.206
Hey, can I have a beer here?

00:08:46.206 --> 00:08:50.043
No. I'm afraid we're closed
for the day. Sorry about that.

00:08:50.043 --> 00:08:51.444
No! It can't be!

00:08:51.444 --> 00:08:54.247
Ryoko!

00:08:54.247 --> 00:08:56.272
You sure are persistent.

00:08:58.384 --> 00:09:02.155
Ryoko, using a snack shop
as your hideout was clever.

00:09:02.155 --> 00:09:03.923
I'm glad you think so.

00:09:03.923 --> 00:09:09.028
But getting yourself involved with the
problems of planet Jurai was not so clever.

00:09:09.028 --> 00:09:11.898
Hey, listen, that wasn't my choice.

00:09:11.898 --> 00:09:14.000
I'll give you a choice, Ryoko.

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.935
I challenge you right here and now!

00:09:49.168 --> 00:09:53.373
Attention, everyone, we will
begin the swimsuit contest shortly.

00:09:53.373 --> 00:09:58.044
Please come over to the registration
desk, if you wish to be a contestant.

00:09:58.044 --> 00:09:59.612
Hey, what am I thinking?

00:09:59.612 --> 00:10:02.916
- I don't have time for this now!
- Really! Come on.

00:10:02.916 --> 00:10:06.386
I've gotta register. I'll see you later.

00:10:06.386 --> 00:10:07.876
'Scuse me?!

00:10:08.488 --> 00:10:12.592
I've already challenged
Ayeka to this swimsuit contest.

00:10:12.592 --> 00:10:16.529
After I'm done with her,
I will accept your challenge, Nagi.

00:10:16.529 --> 00:10:18.622
Just give me a little while.

00:10:22.402 --> 00:10:25.166
If you must, I guess I'll wait.

00:10:31.144 --> 00:10:33.635
Just one more thing, Ryoko.

00:10:34.514 --> 00:10:38.883
Don't lose to anybody else until
we have a chance to fight, okay?

00:10:39.886 --> 00:10:42.655
No problem. I can't lose!

00:10:42.655 --> 00:10:45.021
Not with this swimsuit!

00:10:55.101 --> 00:11:01.870
"Swimsuit Contest"

00:11:14.220 --> 00:11:17.519
"Contestants Dressing Room"

00:11:23.663 --> 00:11:26.899
What's wrong, Kiyone... Aah!

00:11:26.899 --> 00:11:28.601
Wow.

00:11:28.601 --> 00:11:32.005
You've sure got some kind of sunburn.

00:11:32.005 --> 00:11:35.270
And this swimsuit is brand-new, too!

00:11:39.312 --> 00:11:42.815
The day of reckoning has finally come.

00:11:42.815 --> 00:11:45.618
The time has come for you to kneel
down before me and admit your defeat.

00:11:45.618 --> 00:11:48.154
Hmmph. I believe that's my line.

00:11:48.154 --> 00:11:51.824
Just you wait till I show off my perfect body.

00:11:51.824 --> 00:11:53.860
Boast as much as you like.

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:57.163
The audience will tell
us who the true beauty is.

00:11:57.163 --> 00:11:59.165
And then we'll see who's perfect.

00:11:59.165 --> 00:12:02.293
That's right. The audience
will see everything clearly.

00:12:15.415 --> 00:12:17.917
Thank you for waiting, ladies and gentlemen!

00:12:17.917 --> 00:12:18.918
And here we go!

00:12:18.918 --> 00:12:22.251
It's time for our fabulous
swimsuit competition!

00:12:24.390 --> 00:12:29.384
The winner of this contest will
receive one million Jurai as a grand prize!

00:12:32.832 --> 00:12:35.401
And we've chosen these
three judges from the audience!

00:12:35.401 --> 00:12:38.029
Make them feel welcome, won't you?

00:12:41.941 --> 00:12:44.466
Hey, Tenchi, where's Ryo-Ohki?

00:13:06.732 --> 00:13:09.502
And now, our first contestant!

00:13:09.502 --> 00:13:12.538
She describes herself as
a Princess Ayeka look-alike!

00:13:12.538 --> 00:13:14.472
Here she is!

00:13:15.541 --> 00:13:20.346
- Hi, everybody!
- Wow! And we have quite a beautiful
contestant right from the get-go!

00:13:20.346 --> 00:13:21.881
Yeah!

00:13:21.881 --> 00:13:25.351
Ayeka, I'm rooting for you!

00:13:25.351 --> 00:13:27.420
Go home! Boo! Boo!

00:13:27.420 --> 00:13:31.791
Hey, you do look like Princess
Ayeka. I'm really impressed.

00:13:31.791 --> 00:13:33.826
Well, a lot of people would agree with you.

00:13:33.826 --> 00:13:38.097
The only difference I can see is the
real princess is just a little more graceful.

00:13:38.097 --> 00:13:40.766
Oh, really? Is that right?!

00:13:40.766 --> 00:13:43.394
Uh... but I guess that's your opinion.

00:14:02.555 --> 00:14:09.654
And now, here's entry number two,
also a look-alike, of the space pirate Ryoko!

00:14:11.230 --> 00:14:13.790
Hello. Thank you. Thank you.

00:14:16.402 --> 00:14:20.573
Hmmm. Again, she really
is a mirror image of Ryoko!

00:14:20.573 --> 00:14:24.110
This is amazing.
Your resemblance to Ryoko is striking.

00:14:24.110 --> 00:14:27.580
Oh, I'm very flattered that you
think I look like such a beautiful lady.

00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:30.316
Entry number one was a Princess
Ayeka look-alike and now you.

00:14:30.316 --> 00:14:35.087
How did ya get the idea to
impersonate such a villainous duo?

00:14:35.087 --> 00:14:37.056
Well, you know, I have to disagree.

00:14:37.056 --> 00:14:39.358
I don't think Ryoko is such a bad person.

00:14:39.358 --> 00:14:40.960
Really? What do you mean?

00:14:40.960 --> 00:14:43.896
Princess Ayeka is the evil one.

00:14:43.896 --> 00:14:48.067
And that poor, helpless Ryoko is
just being forced to go along with her.

00:14:48.067 --> 00:14:49.557
Oh?

00:14:53.673 --> 00:14:56.976
And now for my personal turn-ons.

00:14:56.976 --> 00:15:01.047
I love sleeping late, drinking early
and taking a bath in the morning.

00:15:01.047 --> 00:15:05.718
She loves sleeping, drinking, and bathing.

00:15:05.718 --> 00:15:08.120
Uh, thank you very much!

00:15:08.120 --> 00:15:10.816
Now you go wait in the box behind us, okay?!

00:15:12.692 --> 00:15:15.684
Well, let's bring in the next contestant!

00:15:18.798 --> 00:15:22.702
Whoa! I gotta say, she's
pretty cute! What do you think?

00:15:22.702 --> 00:15:25.364
She reminds me of my
wife when she was younger.

00:15:37.717 --> 00:15:40.519
Mmm. It looks like a really tough call.

00:15:40.519 --> 00:15:43.189
Yes, it looks grim.
There's a lot of competition.

00:15:43.189 --> 00:15:45.555
Hey, it's Kiyone's turn!

00:15:48.461 --> 00:15:50.896
- Wow!
- All right!

00:15:50.896 --> 00:15:52.523
Huh?

00:15:56.969 --> 00:16:00.406
And the crowd is going wild!
What do you make of this?

00:16:00.406 --> 00:16:03.409
They think she got that
tan from working outside.

00:16:03.409 --> 00:16:05.945
The audience feels she's down to earth.

00:16:05.945 --> 00:16:07.880
So sunburn's the new fashion trend?

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:09.282
Exactly.

00:16:09.282 --> 00:16:12.184
So you think Kiyone
has a chance to win, then?

00:16:12.184 --> 00:16:14.778
Of course she does.

00:16:15.688 --> 00:16:18.557
And as our parade of
contestants draws to a close,

00:16:18.557 --> 00:16:22.425
let's bring out our final contestant right now!

00:16:25.431 --> 00:16:27.066
Wow!

00:16:27.066 --> 00:16:28.968
Mihoshi! Hi!

00:16:28.968 --> 00:16:34.429
Hi! Whoa!

00:16:37.143 --> 00:16:39.211
Now, that had to hurt.

00:16:39.211 --> 00:16:42.715
Am I sensing her score
for poise is going to be low?

00:16:42.715 --> 00:16:46.485
No. She actually may gain
some sympathy points there.

00:16:46.485 --> 00:16:49.221
The judges will now try
to determine the winner.

00:16:49.221 --> 00:16:50.984
Hold it!

00:16:57.229 --> 00:16:58.264
Nagi!

00:16:58.264 --> 00:17:01.290
I'm participating in this contest, too!

00:17:02.902 --> 00:17:07.006
Ladies and gentlemen, it's news to me,
but apparently we have one more contestant.

00:17:07.006 --> 00:17:09.873
What do you think you're doing here?!

00:17:12.345 --> 00:17:15.648
I couldn't pass up an
opportunity to compete.

00:17:15.648 --> 00:17:18.845
This contest will psych
me up for our duel, Ryoko.

00:17:23.422 --> 00:17:25.658
The judges have decided
to allow her to compete!

00:17:25.658 --> 00:17:27.489
Let's see what we've got here!

00:17:28.227 --> 00:17:30.029
Okay!

00:17:30.029 --> 00:17:31.587
Wow!

00:17:33.899 --> 00:17:35.526
Yeah!

00:17:39.805 --> 00:17:42.675
Now she is really something.

00:17:42.675 --> 00:17:44.905
Not bad.

00:18:01.060 --> 00:18:03.688
And now, let's find out our winner!

00:18:10.369 --> 00:18:12.735
Oh, that hurt.

00:18:16.308 --> 00:18:18.071
All right! Please push your buttons!

00:18:19.445 --> 00:18:23.279
And the winner is Nagi, the bounty hunter!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.748
No! I can't believe this!

00:18:32.958 --> 00:18:35.561
Dig it, people. I'm the winner.

00:18:35.561 --> 00:18:39.465
Now, Ryoko, let's get down to business!

00:18:39.465 --> 00:18:41.228
Oh! She's gone!

00:18:53.345 --> 00:18:56.382
Hmph! I can't believe those stupid judges!

00:18:56.382 --> 00:18:59.552
Hey, I haven't completed
the repair work, you know!

00:18:59.552 --> 00:19:00.820
We have an embarrassing situation here!

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:05.280
It looks like somebody has stolen
our one million Jurai prize money!

00:19:06.725 --> 00:19:09.193
I'll just go on ahead, Tenchi!

00:19:19.705 --> 00:19:21.536
There she goes.

00:19:22.641 --> 00:19:24.506
Oh! Ryo-Ohki!

00:19:26.912 --> 00:19:28.277
That's it!

00:19:29.715 --> 00:19:31.376
Help us out!

00:19:45.331 --> 00:19:48.994
Ryo-Ohki, come on! Let's get the others!

00:20:06.952 --> 00:20:10.479
You coward! Come back!

00:20:24.169 --> 00:20:27.039
Look what you've done now, Ryoko.

00:20:27.039 --> 00:20:29.742
Yeah, well, I should have
won that contest anyway.

00:20:29.742 --> 00:20:32.378
The way I see it, the
award is rightfully mine.

00:20:32.378 --> 00:20:34.146
You've got some nerve.

00:20:34.146 --> 00:20:36.815
I was most suited to the grand prize.

00:20:36.815 --> 00:20:39.919
The way I see it, this is my money!

00:20:39.919 --> 00:20:41.487
No, it's mine!

00:20:41.487 --> 00:20:42.922
It's not! It's mine!

00:20:42.922 --> 00:20:45.686
- I said it's mine!
- Don't flatter yourself!

00:20:53.599 --> 00:20:56.932
Ryo-Ohki, where were
you during the contest?

00:22:52.751 --> 00:22:53.886
Hi, everybody.

00:22:53.886 --> 00:22:58.190
On the right, we can see
the security Jurai checkpoint.

00:22:58.190 --> 00:23:02.995
We have to pass through it
to get into the Jurai territory.

00:23:02.995 --> 00:23:04.196
That's the way it is.

00:23:04.196 --> 00:23:08.567
So please, everybody, be careful
about behaving suspiciously.

00:23:08.567 --> 00:23:14.506
We're closer than ever to Jurai,
but the security is really tough.

00:23:14.506 --> 00:23:16.175
Next episode is:
"No Need for a Checkpoint!"

00:23:16.175 --> 00:23:18.477
I'll give 'em a passport they'll never forget!

00:23:18.477 --> 00:23:20.638
It's unquestionably two-fisted!
